## Local Working Agreement
- Read this file before non-trivial work.
- Never put secrets in Dockerfile or Compose files — use `.env.local`.
- Keep `.env.example` updated when adding new environment variables.
- Validate Compose files with `docker compose config` before committing.
- Flag changes to shared volumes or networks before applying.

## Invariants
- App must not run as root in the production image.
- Base image must be pinned to a specific version tag.
- Services with `depends_on` must have healthchecks defined.
- `.env.local` must be in `.gitignore`.

